[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2531058981","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100207#issuecomment-2531058981","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100207","id":2531058981,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6W3OUl","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-10T09:56:23Z","updated_at":"2024-12-10T09:56:23Z","body":"> This is just required for us to get usable traces on Windows at all. If we care about Ubuntu 20.04 we could make it conditional. But I think the percentage of Windows users is a lot higher than the percentage of specifically Ubuntu 20.04 users.\r\n\r\nTo clarify, it is already conditional. My point was whether we should remove the condition and use dwarf-5 everywhere.\r\n\r\nIt seems like on macOS this wouldn't be a good idea (requires Xcode 16) and on Linux it's still unclear what distros would have issues with it (since Adam had issues with it in Fedora early 2023, which would be either Fedora 37 or 36, both of which have binutils > 2.35).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2531058981/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2531120759","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100207#issuecomment-2531120759","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100207","id":2531120759,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6W3dZ3","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-10T10:19:38Z","updated_at":"2024-12-10T10:19:38Z","body":"> can produce up to 25% more compact debug information compared to earlier versions.\"\r\n\r\nWhat's the real symbol size difference on Linux?\r\n\r\nIn case of Windows, it's `3373 MB` with dwarf-4 and `3337 MB` with dwarf-5. Smaller, but nowhere near 25%. macOS symbols for the same build are `689 MB`.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2531120759/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2531285663","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100207#issuecomment-2531285663","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100207","id":2531285663,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6W4Fqf","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-10T11:19:32Z","updated_at":"2024-12-10T11:20:09Z","body":"> > can produce up to 25% more compact debug information compared to earlier versions.\"\r\n> \r\n> What's the real symbol size difference on Linux?\r\n> \r\n> In case of Windows, it's `3373 MB` with dwarf-4 and `3337 MB` with dwarf-5. Smaller, but nowhere near 25%. macOS symbols for the same build are `689 MB`.\r\n\r\nYeah it's definitely not that drastic in our case.\r\nFor dev + SCU builds:  `scons dev_build=yes dev_mode=yes linker=mold scu_build=all`:\r\n\r\nWith LLVM on Linux:\r\n```\r\n-rwxr-xr-x. 1 akien akien 552M Dec 10 12:14 godot.linuxbsd.editor.dev.x86_64.llvm.dwarf4\r\n-rwxr-xr-x. 1 akien akien 545M Dec  9 21:04 godot.linuxbsd.editor.dev.x86_64.llvm.dwarf5\r\n```\r\n\r\nAnd with GCC:\r\n```\r\n-rwxr-xr-x. 1 akien akien 686M Dec 10 12:13 godot.linuxbsd.editor.dev.x86_64.gcc.dwarf4\r\n-rwxr-xr-x. 1 akien akien 664M Dec 10 12:17 godot.linuxbsd.editor.dev.x86_64.gcc.dwarf5\r\n```\r\n\r\nSo it's a 7MB reduction for LLVM (-1.3%) and 22MB for GCC (-3.2%).\r\n\r\nNot really groundbreaking so if we don't have other clear gains from using dwarf-5 everywhere, I think it's fine to keep things as is with dwarf-5 on Windows mingw for libbacktrace and dwarf-4 elsewhere.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2531285663/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2532781984","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100207#issuecomment-2532781984","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100207","id":2532781984,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6W9y-g","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-10T20:17:01Z","updated_at":"2024-12-10T20:17:01Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2532781984/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]